cmslb00oe0006qm01s0thzc6h	chadhava	Can I choose the temple for my Chadava?	Yes. You can select your preferred temple from the available options before placing your Chadava order.\n	1	t	2026-08-09 04:29:41.87	\N
cmslc9cxk000sqm0187qcyi1r	ecommerce	Are the products suitable for gifting?	Yes. Our spiritual products make thoughtful gifts for festivals, religious occasions, housewarmings, and loved ones seeking divine blessings.\n	6	t	2026-08-09 05:04:57.273	\N
cmslb2pdj000aqm01kc3bpfw0	epuja	Can I book an ePuja for someone else?	Yes. You can book an ePuja for yourself or your family members by entering the devotee's details during the booking process.\n	1	t	2026-08-09 04:31:47.192	\N
cmslb3uye000bqm019vyo055f	epuja	What if I don't know my Gotra?	If you don't know your Gotra, don't worry. Kashyap Gotra will be considered by default, and your ePuja will be performed accordingly.\n	2	t	2026-08-09 04:32:41.078	\N
cmslb0jbx0007qm01x5xd2mxp	chadhava	Can I dedicate a Chadava for my family or loved ones?	Absolutely! You can book a Chadava for yourself or someone else by providing the devotee's details during booking.\n	2	t	2026-08-09 04:30:06.045	\N
cmslb1yog0009qm01nqlsiy2z	chadhava	What happens after I place my Chadava order?	After your booking is confirmed, the temple processes your offering according to its schedule. Once the Chadava is offered, you'll receive the video in your Mandir Setu app within 7 days.\n	4	t	2026-08-09 04:31:12.592	\N
cmslb1c7c0008qm01egb3osjk	chadhava	What if I don't know my Gotra?	No worries! If your Gotra is unknown, Kashyap Gotra will be considered by default while offering your Chadava.\n	3	t	2026-08-09 04:30:43.464	\N
cmslb56yq000cqm01ytc2a4j2	epuja	How will I receive confirmation that my puja was performed?	Once your ePuja is completed, a video of the ritual will be uploaded to your Mandir Setu app. You can view it within 7 days of the puja being performed.\n	3	t	2026-08-09 04:33:43.298	\N
cmslb5tpu000dqm01gwpunu5g	epuja	Can I make changes after booking my ePuja?	If your puja has not yet been scheduled, please contact our support team as soon as possible. We will do our best to accommodate your request.\n	4	t	2026-08-09 04:34:12.786	\N
cmslb6q45000eqm01kr6a5m6w	home	How long does it take for the puja to be performed?	ePujas are performed as per the temple's schedule. Once completed, the puja video will be available in your Mandir Setu app within 7 days.\n	5	t	2026-08-09 04:34:54.773	\N
cmslb83jb000fqm01xo5r03g7	kundli	Can I choose the type of Kundli or Varga Chart I need?	Yes. Mandir Setu offers a variety of Kundlis and Varga Charts. Simply select the one that best suits your requirements before placing your order.\n	1	t	2026-08-09 04:35:58.824	\N
cmslb8jta000gqm01o2gd0uf2	home	Can I order a Kundli for someone else?\t	Yes. You can order a Kundli or Varga Chart for your family members or loved ones by entering their correct birth details during the booking process.\n	2	t	2026-08-09 04:36:19.919	\N
cmslb92zr000hqm012f4etcd5	kundli	Is my Kundli AI-generated?\t	No. Every Kundli and Varga Chart is personally prepared and handwritten by experienced astrologers, ensuring authentic and personalized astrological guidance.\n	3	t	2026-08-09 04:36:44.775	\N
cmslb9jtk000iqm015txvvxvp	kundli	Will I receive a handwritten Kundli?\t	Yes. Every Kundli is carefully handwritten by expert astrologers, offering a detailed and personalized report instead of an automatically generated one.\n	4	t	2026-08-09 04:37:06.584	\N
cmslba5ny000jqm01zqn11of4	kundli	How long does it take to receive my Kundli?\t	Once your payment is confirmed and the required details are submitted, your handwritten Kundli or Varga Chart will be prepared by our expert astrologers and delivered within the committed timeline.\n	5	t	2026-08-09 04:37:34.894	\N
cmslbgcbz000kqm0140riq798	jyotish	How do I consult a Jyotishi?\t	Simply choose your preferred consultation package, complete the payment, and join the consultation at your scheduled time.\n	1	t	2026-08-09 04:42:23.471	\N
cmslbgtog000lqm01gxtdxf30	home	Are the Jyotishis experienced?\t	Yes. All Jyotishis on Mandir Setu are experienced astrologers with expertise in Vedic astrology and spiritual guidance.	2	t	2026-08-09 04:42:45.953	\N
cmslbh9ou000mqm01jb7nnnzg	jyotish	Can I ask about any life concern during the consultation?\t	Yes. You can seek guidance on topics such as career, marriage, relationships, health, finances, education, family, and other personal concerns.\n	3	t	2026-08-09 04:43:06.702	\N
cmslbhxs0000nqm01ktjgk7zq	home	How long is a Jyotishi consultation?\t	Mandir Setu offers multiple consultation durations. You can choose the package that best suits your needs before booking.\n	4	t	2026-08-09 04:43:37.92	\N
cmslbifna000oqm01ylz0lugu	jyotish	Will my consultation remain private?\t	Yes. Your consultation and the information you share with the Jyotishi are kept completely confidential.	5	t	2026-08-09 04:44:01.078	\N
cmslc7kkd000pqm01qa36cmmb	ecommerce	What products are available in the Puja Store?\t	You can shop for a wide range of spiritual products, including Rudrakshas, bracelets, brass idols, gemstones, pyramids, devotional frames, and more.\n	1	t	2026-08-09 05:03:33.853	\N
cmslc7xju000qqm01ykenome7	ecommerce	Will my order be delivered to my doorstep?\t	Yes. Once your order is confirmed, it will be carefully packed and delivered directly to your doorstep.\n	2	t	2026-08-09 05:03:50.682	\N
cmslc8gz3000rqm01t0d0h46s	ecommerce	How do I place an order from the Puja Store?\t	Simply browse the available products, add your preferred items to the cart, complete the payment, and we'll take care of the rest.\n	3	t	2026-08-09 05:04:15.856	\N
cmslc9vsu000tqm01ofeln4wy	ecommerce	Can I order multiple products in a single purchase?\t	Absolutely! You can add multiple items from the Puja Store to your cart and place a single order for convenient delivery.\n	5	t	2026-08-09 05:05:21.726	\N
cmslcbckb000uqm01wrty41sa	yatra	What is the Yatra service?	The Yatra service helps you plan your pilgrimage with a personalized itinerary based on your destination, preferences, and travel requirements.\n\n	1	t	2026-08-09 05:06:30.108	\N
cmslcbquv000vqm01i5aki873	yatra	How do I book a Yatra?\t	Simply fill in the required travel details, complete the booking, and our team will begin planning your pilgrimage.\n	2	t	2026-08-09 05:06:48.631	\N
cmslcc3wl000wqm014ja25hxi	yatra	When will I receive my travel plan?\t	Your personalized Yatra plan will be shared with you within 48–72 hours after your booking is confirmed.\n	3	t	2026-08-09 05:07:05.541	\N
cmslcco0d000xqm01vzrjmj2e	yatra	What does the personalized Yatra plan include?\t	Your itinerary may include temple visits, travel recommendations, accommodation suggestions, sightseeing, and other essential details for a smooth pilgrimage.\n	4	t	2026-08-09 05:07:31.598	\N
cmslccyx7000yqm01601zdy97	home	Who prepares my Yatra plan?\t	Our dedicated Yatra team carefully designs each itinerary to provide a hassle-free and spiritually enriching pilgrimage experience.\n	5	t	2026-08-09 05:07:45.739	\N
