cmsn7mvv00015p001b6e6wf6a	Drekkana (D3) Chart	The D3 Chart divides each sign into three equal parts, revealing insights on siblings, family relationships, and mental strength.\nIt shows courage, determination, and the influence of familial karma on sibling dynamics.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1tUQPzSKXAifxfS4CdulSGLrKehaURCg0&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:31:02.604	Assesses courage, determination and mental resilience.\nReveals sibling relationships and family dynamics.\nShows the influence of familial karma.\nStrong placements support harmony among siblings.	\N	Siblings & Courage	Divides each zodiac sign into three equal parts, centred on siblings, family bonds and inner strength.
cmsn7fuib000tp001wicxxg94	Navamsa Kundli	The Navamsa Chart divides each zodiac sign into nine parts (108 Navamsas), offering deep insight into marriage, partner quality, and true planetary strength.\nKnown as the 'chart of luck,' it's closely linked to destiny and spiritual growth.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1V9rg6lH5P7Z6SiADnVdMXVNJwuVZYBX8&sz=w1000	3000	2100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:25:34.259	Gives deep insight into marriage, marital happiness and partner quality.\nReveals the true strength of planets beyond the main birth chart.\nHelps time relationship success or challenges.\nSheds light on spiritual growth and overall destiny.	\N	Marriage & Destiny	Divides each zodiac sign into nine parts (108 Navamsas in all); known as the 'chart of luck' for its close link to the 9th house of destiny.
cmsmznguh000gqj01jwy2balo	Test	test	test	/uploads/733564da-8d38-470d-ab76-571b49ffa325.webp	1500	1098	0	t	2026-08-10 08:47:32.873	\N	\N	\N	\N
cmsn7h1bh000vp001810eruu0	Chalit (D9) Chart	The Chalit Chart adjusts planetary positions from the Lagna chart to reflect actual house placements, offering more accurate predictions for Dasha and Bhukti periods.\nIt clarifies unexpected results and helps assess impacts on relationships, career, and health.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=19fxxm6BD0_S_s7H_Ni4zJVwV2rveBClY&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:26:29.741	Clarifies the real house effects behind unexpected results.\nImproves accuracy of Dasha and Bhukti period predictions.\nHelps assess impact on relationships, career and health.\nResolves timing discrepancies missed by the basic birth chart.	\N	Accurate House Placements	Refines planetary positions from the Lagna (Rasi) chart to reflect true house placement rather than sign alone, sharpening prediction accuracy.
cmsn7eksh000rp001j34d0pcs	Chandra Kundli	Chandra Kundli places the Moon sign as the first house, centering analysis on emotions, instincts, and mental strength.\nIt's key for Dasha and transit predictions, relationship compatibility, and understanding family and health influences.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1i9pNdPHobyydBlOU36FEo3l_d08pmSOX&sz=w1000	3000	2100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:24:35.009	Assesses mental state, mood patterns and intuition.\nEssential for accurate Dasha and transit (Gochar) predictions.\nUseful for checking emotional and mental compatibility in relationships.\nHighlights influence on mother, family and nurturing nature.	\N	Mind & Emotions	Places the Moon sign as the first house, making it the key chart for understanding emotional and psychological nature.
cmsn7i75b000xp0019yuye0xt	Dashamsa (D10)Chart	The D10 Dashamsa Chart divides each zodiac sign into 10 equal parts, focusing on career, profession, and the results of effort (Karma Bhava).\nStrong planets here indicate professional success, while highlighting career timing and challenges.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1gQJSkUxoIt4smvunwnGTzYnQWB6p3NVK&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:27:23.951	Shows initiative, work ability and career progression.\nIdentifies periods of professional success or challenge.\nReveals the timing of career achievements.\nOffers workplace-specific insight beyond the birth chart.	\N	Career & Profession	Divides each zodiac sign into 10 equal parts, dedicated to Karma Bhava — career, profession and the results of one's efforts.
cmsn7jdpw000zp001bc7fclm8	Saptamsa (D7) Chart	The D7 Chart divides each zodiac sign into seven parts, representing progeny and creativity.\nIt helps predict the number, health, and well-being of children, with planets like Jupiter and Venus indicating fertility and fulfilling relationships.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1hx1ipgkKBX5AgC6T8902nqARG9eoTJHH&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:28:19.124	Predicts the number, health and well-being of children.\nHighlights fertility prospects and related concerns.\nEvaluates Jupiter and Venus placement for fruitful progeny.\nFlags possible delays or complications in family planning.	\N	Children & Progeny	Divides each zodiac sign into seven equal parts, focused on progeny, fertility and creative potential.
cmsn7kkp50011p001h8liozmg	Chaturvimsa (D24) Chart	The D24 Chart divides each zodiac sign into 24 parts, reflecting education, academic success, and intellectual development.\nIt reveals subject interests and skill acquisition, and predicts success in exams, research, and spiritual studies.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=12vIFJf2ZLMumPUSLeQkNyO0VUFeixzS9&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:29:14.825	Reflects academic potential and likelihood of success.\nShows interest areas and natural skill acquisition.\nIdentifies obstacles in education and higher study.\nPredicts outcomes in exams, research and spiritual studies.	\N	Education & Learning	Divides each zodiac sign into 24 equal parts, dedicated to learning ability, education and intellectual growth.
cmsn7lq2a0013p001i8q7jyma	Dwadasamsa (D12) Chart	The D12 Chart divides each zodiac sign into 12 parts, mapping ancestral influences and karmic debts across generations.\nIt reveals inherited blessings or curses, family background, and past-life connections shaping your current life.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1W3ScjWyxRtQ_ze5bEqRG8GtcFn6tYv7g&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:30:08.434	Reveals inherited blessings, curses and karmic debts.\nLinks past karma to present relationships and personality traits.\nUncovers parental and family background influence.\nDeepens understanding of past-life connections and rooted fears.	\N	Ancestry & Karma	Divides each zodiac sign into 12 equal parts, mapping ancestral influence and karmic inheritance across generations.
cmsn7pe330019p0013tibxvkb	Ashthamsa (D8) Chart	The D8 Chart reveals sudden, unexpected events and life crises such as accidents or lawsuits.\nIt's used to study legacy, lifespan, and inheritance potential, offering insight into hidden fears and major turning points.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1bPUxsvUKSjxIWRqZeX4qlpxLF_Uo9d9B&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:32:59.536	Prepares for sudden misfortunes, accidents or legal issues.\nAssesses lifespan and inheritance potential.\nIdentifies hidden fears and obstacles.\nOffers insight for navigating major life crises.	\N	Crisis & Transformation	Reveals sudden, unexpected life events and turning points, including risks, legacy and inheritance matters.
cmsn7qie4001bp001skg0q7kp	Bhava Kundli	Bhava Kundli divides the sky into 12 houses reflecting life facets like health, wealth, relationships, and career, with the Ascendant as the first house.\nBhava corrections adjust house boundaries for more accurate predictions of dashas and major life events.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1S9_YDEc_VuEQfLBRIoQfEukuA6gU9C1p&sz=w1000	3000	2100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:33:51.773	More accurate than sign-based charts due to exact ascendant correction.\nClarifies personality and life path through the 1st house.\nIdentifies specific challenges and strengths per life area.\nEssential for analysing Dasha periods and major life events.	\N	House-Wise Life Map	Divides the sky into 12 precisely corrected houses covering every facet of life, from health to career.
cmsn7rq6l001dp001dmb8pm7v	Dasha Chart	Dasha is a planetary timing system, most commonly the Vimshottari Dasha, dividing life into 120 years of planetary periods that predict major events like career changes, marriage, and health.\nSub-periods (Antardasha and Pratyantardasha) refine timing further based on each planet's condition.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1-qmTzYMs5aUyArvjlXCn76VAd-FTsyyK&sz=w1000	3000	2100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:34:48.525	Predicts the timing of career shifts, marriage and health events.\nBreaks periods into Antardasha and Pratyantardasha for precision.\nClarifies whether upcoming periods bring favourable or challenging results.\nA central tool for planning major life decisions.	\N	Life Timing & Periods	The planetary timing system (typically Vimshottari Dasha) showing when specific planetary influences take effect over a 120-year cycle.
cmsn7sy39001fp001l0o1m16m	Gan Category	Gan reflects temperament based on the Moon's position at birth, dividing Nakshatras into Dev, Manushya, and Rakshasa Gans, representing spiritual, practical, and assertive natures respectively.\nGan matching is vital for marriage compatibility in Vedic astrology.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1PaCAf5sLCex4yNC_aPld0UrbX_ucIXv9&sz=w1000	3000	2100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:35:45.43	Reveals core personality tendencies and behavioural style.\nA key factor in marriage compatibility matching.\nExplains natural strengths such as compassion, ambition or leadership.\nRemedies are available to resolve Gan-related mismatches.	\N	Temperament & Compatibility	Classifies nature and temperament (Dev, Manushya, Rakshasa) based on the Moon's Nakshatra at birth.
cmsn7u2wh001hp0011ddohuwj	Hora Chart (D2)chart	The Hora Chart (D2) splits each zodiac sign into two halves ruled by the Sun or Moon, focusing on financial status, wealth potential, and income sources.\nIt helps predict financial stability, gains, losses, and auspicious periods for wealth growth.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1WlkD_QKxTNjaJLRckrGCUAEOqvnd94I7&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:36:38.321	Assesses income sources and wealth potential.\nComplements the birth chart with money-specific insight.\nPredicts financial stability, gains and losses.\nHighlights auspicious periods for financial growth.	\N	Wealth & Finance	Splits each zodiac sign into two halves ruled by the Sun or Moon, focused entirely on financial standing.
cmsn7vbhx001jp001ow53px00	Lagna (D1) Chart	The Lagna Chart is based on the zodiac sign rising at birth, shaping personality, physical appearance, and longevity.\nThe Lagna lord's strength is crucial for health and life success, and this chart is the base for all dashas, transits, and divisional readings.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1GrDMEmFujocyoHUymNFCZjg1IOMi4oKY&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:37:36.117	Shapes understanding of physical traits, vitality and character.\nForms the foundation for health and longevity analysis.\nEssential base for Dasha, transit and divisional readings.\nRequires precise birth time for accurate interpretation.	\N	Foundation & Identity	The primary chart based on the rising sign at birth; the base for every other divisional chart and prediction.
cmsn7wfw0001lp001scxad77q	Nadi Category	Nadi Categories divide Nakshatras into Adi, Madhya, and Antya groups linked to body energies: Vata, Pitta, and Kapha.\nUsed mainly for marriage matching, it assesses genetic and health compatibility along with personality and temperament.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1-5J1Yh_Ep_F8pHjguhAkhF5F3WLydoak&sz=w1000	3000	2100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:38:28.465	Assesses genetic and hereditary compatibility for marriage.\nIdentifies health risks tied to body constitution.\nOffers insight into temperament and past-life patterns.\nAn important component of predictive remedies.	\N	Health & Genetic Compatibility	Groups Nakshatras into Adi, Madhya and Antya categories tied to body energies (Vata, Pitta, Kapha).
cmsn7xn1t001np001lmcmpjhv	Panchamsa (D5) Chart	The D5 Chart divides each zodiac sign into five parts, focusing on creative expression, intelligence, and children.\nIt reveals artistic talents, offspring's qualities, and predicts success in creative fields.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1_9Y8hoRdx0ec9bB5a2UeFWT3S8Uj6jVm&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:39:24.401	Reveals intellectual and artistic potential.\nHighlights talent in performing arts and writing.\nShows offspring's creative qualities.\nPredicts success in creative careers and mental sharpness.	\N	Creativity & Intellect	Divides each zodiac sign into five equal parts, linked to creative expression, intelligence and artistic talent.
cmsn7yvgl001rp001kpwuqk0g	Rashi Chart	The Rashi Chart divides the sky into 12 zodiac signs based on the Moon's position at birth, representing mind, emotions, and instinctive nature.\nIt determines personality and behavior, and forms the foundation for Dasha-based predictions.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1SHpWQfvSeH822IA_s7u4O_vIh8B6ON-p&sz=w1000	3000	2100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:40:21.957	Reveals core personality and emotional responses.\nStrongly influences destiny and how life unfolds.\nForms the foundation for Dasha-based predictions.\nUseful for everyday behavioural understanding.	\N	Moon Sign & Instinct	Based on the Moon's position at birth, representing mind, emotion and instinctive behaviour.
