cmsn81b8g001vp001esvd164h	Shashtahamsa (D6) Chart	The D6 Chart divides each zodiac sign into six parts, linked to health, diseases, and obstacles through the 6th house.\nIt identifies hidden vulnerabilities, karmic health lessons, and areas needing resilience or healing.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1VVD0XHghV58moIroM9LiQYqKwWKFdA6K&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:42:15.712	Identifies energy leaks and karmic health lessons.\nAssesses resilience against illness and adversaries.\nReveals areas vulnerable to struggle.\nGuides spiritual healing and remedy planning.	\N	Health & Obstacles	Linked to the 6th house, revealing health challenges, hidden vulnerabilities and obstacles.
cmsn82kqa001xp001kk7y2zbc	Shodamsa (D16) Chart	The D16 Chart divides each zodiac sign into 16 parts, focusing on movable assets and material comforts like vehicles and luxuries.\nVenus placement indicates mental satisfaction, lifestyle stability, and happiness derived from possessions.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1KG0QI_BZquwHk23DbOgxv4Za71BGVtzg&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:43:14.674	Reflects enjoyment of vehicles, luxuries and possessions.\nVenus placement shows mental satisfaction and healing.\nIndicates lifestyle stability and happiness.\nPredicts resilience amid material or emotional challenges.	\N	Comforts & Lifestyle	Divides each zodiac sign into 16 parts, centred on movable assets, comforts and material fulfilment.
cmsn83q0r001zp001xnztp2x7	Trikona Chart	Trikona houses (1st, 5th, 9th) form a triangle symbolizing core life goals, righteousness, and spiritual purpose.\nStrong planets here indicate karmic blessings, wisdom, good fortune, and leadership qualities.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1W_YUtZxE-upPls4YAy-M0byrvuzsMkOT&sz=w1000	3000	2100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:44:08.187	Reveals righteousness, intelligence and creative potential.\nShows karmic blessings and past-life merits.\nSupports wisdom, fortune and leadership qualities.\nHarmonises body, mind and soul for higher purpose.	\N	Dharma & Life Purpose	Focuses on the Trikona houses (1st, 5th, 9th), the triangle representing core life purpose and spiritual direction.
cmsn84wpt0021p0019dmcfu14	Trimsamsa (D30) Chart	The D30 Chart divides each zodiac sign into 30 parts, revealing deep karmic effects, health issues, and recurring challenges from past lives.\nIt shows how a person handles misfortune, and highlights inner emotions like anger or greed affecting life.\nYou will receive authentic handwritten Kundlis, carefully crafted by expert pandits. Unlike AI-generated charts, each Kundli in our app is created manually, ensuring traditional accuracy and personalized attention.	E-Scan PDF + Pocket Printout	https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1JlIZVcwUjh1uKuUkxYypzH4dAcu4y11c&sz=w1000	6000	5100	0	f	2026-08-10 12:45:03.521	Highlights recurring health issues and internal weaknesses.\nReveals hidden adversities and psychological patterns.\nExplains how a person deals with misfortune and disease.\nIdentifies inner emotions driving life's obstacles.	\N	Hidden Struggles	Divides each zodiac sign into 30 one-degree parts, exposing deep karmic effects and subconscious challenges.
